{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40513","headline":"蜘蛛谕 · 苏拯","name":"蜘蛛谕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春蚕吐出丝，济世功不绝。\n蜘蛛吐出丝，飞虫成聚血。\n蚕丝何专利，尔丝何专孽。\n映日张网罗，遮天亦何别。\n傥居要地门，害物可堪说。\n网成虽福己，网败还祸尔。\n小人与君子，利害一如此。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏拯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40513.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40513","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}